    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "James G Coughlan & Associates are delighted to bring 7 Highfields Maryborough Woods, Maryborough Hill, Douglas, to the market.  Ideally located in a quiet cul-de-sac just minutes from Douglas and all its services.  First time buyers will be particularly interested in this 2 bedroomed, end of terrace, residence is not only in walk-in condition, but it enjoys a large corner site for future expansion.  Viewing is highly recommended by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "LIVING ROOM:\r\n15ft.6 x 13ft.9.Cast-iron fireplace with raised marble hearth and Pine surround, radiator, 6 power points, 2 lights and 1 window.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN/DINING ROOM:\r\n16ft x 11ft.9. Light Oak shaker style kitchen with floor and eye level units, basin and a half stainless steel sink, separate hob and oven, extractor hood, integrated fridge/freezer and dishwasher, plumbed for washer/dryer, light Oak floor, built-in storage press, radiator, 9 power points, 1 light 2 recessed lights and 1 window.\r\n\r\nDOWNSTAIRS TOILET:\r\n2-piece white suite, extractor fan, 1 light.\r\n\r\nLANDING with 1 light and 1 window.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM:\r\n3-piece white suite, electric shower over bath, radiator, 1 light and 1 window.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM NO. 1:\r\n15ft.6 x 9ft.3. Wall to wall built-in wardrobes with double mirror, radiator, 8 power points, 1 light and 2 windows.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM NO. 2:\r\n13ft.6 x 7ft.9.  Double slide robes, radiator, 4 power points, 1 light and 1 window.\r\n\r\n\r\nMessrs. James G. Coughlan & Associates for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of this property whose Agents they are given notice that:1)  The particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchaser or lessees, and do not constitute, nor constitute part of, an offer or contract.  2)  All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation and other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct but any      intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them.  3)  No Person in the employment of Messrs. James G. Coughlan & Associates has the authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tFREEHOLD TITLE\r\n•\tNATURAL GAS CENTRAL HEATING\r\n•\tDOUBLE GLAZING IN PVC\r\n•\tLARGE CORNER SITE\r\n•\tSOUGHT AFTER LOCATION\r\n•\tEXCELLENT CONDITION\r\n•\tMINUTES FROM DOUGLAS"
      },
